course: dictionary
lesson: 5549
title: Legumes: plants with pods
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A legume is a plant that grows its seeds in pods. When you meet a new word, look at the words around it, because they are its context and they leave clues.
explain: «Peanuts are not true nuts; they are legumes, like peas and beans, and their pods grow underground.» The words like peas and beans are clues. A legume is a family of plants, and peas and beans are two members of it.
explain: The word also means the seeds or pods we eat from these plants. If a recipe says «add a tin of legumes», it means the beans or peas inside, not the plant in a field. Swap your meaning into the sentence to check it still makes sense.
fact: A legume is a plant that grows its seeds in pods.
fact: Peas, beans, lentils, peanuts and clover are all legumes.
fact: Peanuts are legumes, even though we call them nuts.
fact: Legumes are rich in protein and fibre, so they are good for healthy food.
fact: The roots of legumes hold tiny bacteria that add nitrogen to the soil, which helps farmers grow crops.
exercise: «Peanuts are not true nuts; they are legumes, like peas and beans.» What is a legume? | A kind of fish that lives in rivers | A metal used to make tools | *A plant that grows its seeds in pods
exercise: Which of these is NOT a legume? | Clover | *Potato | Pea | Lentil
exercise: A recipe says «add a tin of legumes». What does legumes mean here? | Plastic bags for shopping | *The beans or peas we eat | Sharp garden tools | The roots of a tree
test: Find and copy one word from «Peanuts are not true nuts; they are legumes, like peas and beans, and their pods grow underground.» that names the part of the plant where the seeds grow. | *pods | nuts | underground | peanuts
test: Why do farmers value legumes? | *Their roots add nitrogen to the soil | They are only grown for their colour | They need no water or light to grow | They make the soil dry and hard
exam: Which sentence uses the word legume correctly? | A legume is a sweet made from sugar | A legume is a bird that lays its eggs in a nest | *A legume is a plant whose seeds grow in pods | A legume is a tool for digging holes
